<resources>

    <!--
        Russian.

        Terminology held to throughout:
        · «фишки» are the physical tokens, «наличные» the real money. Keeping those apart is the
          app's central hazard and matters as much here as in English.
        · «касса» is the bank that issues and buys back chips, deliberately not «банк», which in
          Russian poker means the pot.
        · «бай-ин», «ребай», «блайнд», «стек» are the terms Russian-speaking players actually use.
        · Field names arrive as arguments inside error messages, so those messages are phrased
          with a colon («Малый блайнд: обязательное поле») rather than agreeing with the noun's
          gender, which the app cannot know.
    -->

